# TBCGuide - Tauren start: Camp Narache and Mulgore (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_Tauren_Mulgore
@name Camp Narache & Mulgore
@faction Horde
@races Tauren
@levels 1-11
@zone Mulgore
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Tauren starting route. Camp Narache and Red Cloud Mesa to about 6, then Bloodhoof Village, the Winterhoof and Thunderhorn totems, the Venture Co. mine and Thunder Bluff. Ends at about 11, heading into the Barrens.
@next H_Barrens

